    "hash": "f626848302308475d743c214b36c9165d9934c1f2e99aae1233924b3169daed2",
    "summary_one_sentence": "After being left at the altar in Rome, a heartbroken schoolteacher embarks on his prepaid Italian honeymoon alone, discovering unexpected friendship, vibrant culture, and a second chance at love.",
    "summary_short": "When Matt Taylor is left at the altar during his dream destination wedding in Rome, he is forced to navigate a prepaid honeymoon across Italy all by himself. Encouraged by two eccentric married couples on the tour, Matt begins to step out of his shell and embrace the vibrant sights, rich culture, and food of Italy. His solitary journey takes a romantic turn when he connects with Gia, a charming local café owner who helps him move past his heartbreak. Ultimately, Matt learns that an unexpected ending can become the beginning of a far better chapter in life.",
    "summary_long": "Matt Taylor travels to Italy anticipating a fairytale destination wedding, but his dreams are shattered when his fiancée leaves him at the altar with only a note calling off the ceremony. Heartbroken and unable to secure a refund for their prepaid honeymoon package, Matt reluctantly decides to undertake the tour alone. During the group excursions, he meets two quirky couples who take him under their wing and offer unconventional relationship advice. While exploring Rome, Matt frequents a cozy local café and hits it off with its charming owner, Gia, who offers to show him around. As they spend time together in Tuscany and connect over food, culture, and family, a genuine romance begins to blossom between them. However, complications arise when Matt finally confesses the true reason behind his solitary trip and shows Gia his ex-fiancée's note. Gia realizes she had unknowingly counseled his ex prior to the wedding, leading to a temporary rift between them. After gaining full closure from a final conversation with his ex-fiancée, Matt realizes he is ready to move forward. He sells his original engagement ring, buys a motorcycle, and returns to Gia's café to express his true feelings. Gia forgives him and accepts his invitation to a concert, marking the start of an inspiring new chapter together.",
    "synopsis": "Solo Mio is a heartwarming romantic comedy-drama that follows Matt Taylor, an American schoolteacher whose dream destination wedding in Rome falls apart when his fiancée unexpectedly leaves him at the altar. Stuck with a non-refundable, all-inclusive honeymoon itinerary across Italy, Matt reluctantly decides to embark on the journey by himself. Along the way, he is befriended by two unique couples who offer solace and humor amidst his grief, while the stunning Italian backdrop and rich culinary traditions slowly reignite his spirit. When Matt crosses paths with Gia, a vibrant local café owner, their instant connection challenges him to heal from his past and open his heart to unexpected possibilities. The film blends humor, culture, and heartfelt emotion to explore self-discovery and second chances in love.",
